  "description": "All Nae-Un Kim ever wanted was to become the best surgeon she could be. She’s satisfied, even if there’s no time for herself. But when her power-hungry father sends her on a blind date, her life is thrown into chaos. Kang-Joon Cha is a legend–and not just because of his powerful family. He’s a brilliant and respected surgeon in his own right. As busy as he is, it’s no wonder he’s single--unless there's another reason. Can this pair thread the needle? Or will this relationship end before it starts? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
